How to be listed here:

This file records contributions to the code.  Testing, bug reports, feedback and
other help that did not produce commits are acknowledged in the papers
describing the library instead.

Code contributions arrive through pull requests on
https://github.com/omega-icl/mcpp.  Add yourself to the group that fits your
contribution, in the same form as the entries above, as part of the pull request
that makes it.


